{"3350850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Coco's Revenge", "steam_appid": 3350850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JUMP, PHASE &amp; ROTATE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky has been stolen, and only you as one of three physics breaking bunnies, can bring it back. <br><br>In Coco's Revenge, you’ll hop, phase, and rotate your way through a retro 2D precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shift between positive and negative space, and rotate entire stages with the help of your fairy friend to set the fastest stage times possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on tough challenges and stare down bosses, all in the name of saving the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ stages, including <i>Secret Stages</i> and <i>Challenges</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Biomes and Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack featuring acoustic melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay mechanics involving spatial awareness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Playable Characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><i>Coco's Revenge</i><strong> Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JUMP, PHASE &amp; ROTATE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sky has been stolen, and only you as one of three physics breaking bunnies, can bring it back. <br><br>In Coco's Revenge, you’ll hop, phase, and rotate your way through a retro 2D precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shift between positive and negative space, and rotate entire stages with the help of your fairy friend to set the fastest stage times possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on tough challenges and stare down bosses, all in the name of saving the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ stages, including <i>Secret Stages</i> and <i>Challenges</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Biomes and Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack featuring acoustic melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic gameplay mechanics involving spatial awareness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Playable Characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><i>Coco's Revenge</i><strong> Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs